## Modules: fluxbox-panel.sys
## Fluxbox-style round-ended panel.
## Module Actions

## Drop Menu

DestroyMenu MenuPanel
AddToMenu MenuPanel
+ "Restart " Restart
+ "Identify " Module FvwmIdent
Test (x FvwmPrompt) + "FvwmPrompt " Exec exec xterm "FvwmPrompt"
Test (!x FvwmPrompt) + "FvwmConsole " Module FvwmConsole -terminal
+ "Fvwm Wallpapers" Popup BGMenu item +0 -100m

## Icons

SetEnv boxIcons $[EXT_DIR]/Modules/FluxPanel/panel

## Panel

DestroyModuleConfig FvwmPanel: *
*FvwmPanel: Geometry 812x30+$[math./.$[math.-.$[monitor.$[monitor.primary].width],812],2]-8
*FvwmPanel: Fore #ffffff
*FvwmPanel: Back #181818
*FvwmPanel: PressColorset 4
*FvwmPanel: Frame 0
*FvwmPanel: Rows 1
*FvwmPanel: Pixmap none
*FvwmPanel: Font "xft:Sans:size=11:antialias=True"
*FvwmPanel: (15x1, Icon $[boxIcons]/left-round.png, Padding 0 0 )

# MenuStart button
*FvwmPanel: (90x1, Icon $[boxIcons]/Fvwm-58x20.png, Colorset 40, ActionOnPress, Action(Mouse 1) Menu MenuPanel Rectangle +$left-34 0 -111m)

*FvwmPanel: (722x1, Swallow (UseOld) FvwmIconMan 'Module FvwmIconMan', Frame 0)
*FvwmPanel: (2x1, Colorset 40, Padding 0 0)

# Dialog box (300x150), adds text on the top of list.
*FvwmPanel: (58x1, Title "Note", ActiveColorset 41, Action `Exec exec sh -c 'note=$(zenity --text-info --editable --title="" --text="" --width=300 --height=150) && [ -n "$note" ] && file="$HOME/Desktop/notes.txt" && tmp=$(mktemp) && printf "# %s\n%s\n\n" "$(date "+%d-%m-%Y")" "$note" > "$tmp" && [ -f "$file" ] && cat "$file" >> "$tmp"; mv "$tmp" "$file"'`)

*FvwmPanel: (2x1, Colorset 40, Padding 0 0)

# How-to-do, opens readme.txt
*FvwmPanel: (20x1, Title "?", ActionOnPress, ActiveColorset 41, Action(Mouse 1) $[infostore.EDT] $[EXT_DIR]/Modules/FluxPanel/readme.txt)

*FvwmPanel: (30x1, Colorset 40, Padding 0 0)
*FvwmPanel: (15x1, Icon $[boxIcons]/right-round.png, Padding 0 0 )

Module FvwmButtons FvwmPanel

## Style Setting

Style FvwmPanel !Borders, !Title, WindowListSkip, StaysOnTop, Sticky, CirculateSkip, NeverFocus
Style FvwmPanel StartsOnScreen $[monitor.primary]

## FvwmIconMan

# Custom function to restore, raise, and warp the viewport.

DestroyFunc IconManClick
AddToFunc IconManClick
+ I Iconify off
+ I Raise
+ I Focus

DestroyFunc IconManMinimize
AddToFunc IconManMinimize
+ I Thumbnail ## Iconify on

# Calls the menu to appear above the bottom screen edge.

DestroyFunc TriggerIconManMenu
AddToFunc TriggerIconManMenu
+ I Menu MenuIconManWindowOps Mouse +0-0 -111m

# Define the context menu layout

DestroyMenu MenuIconManWindowOps
AddToMenu MenuIconManWindowOps "Win Options: " Title
+ "Maximize"  Maximize
+ "Iconify"   Thumbnail
+ "Close"     Close
+ ""          Nop
+ "Move to.."
+ "  Web Desk"     MoveToDesk 0 0
+ "  Email Desk"   MoveToDesk 0 1
+ "  Office Desk"  MoveToDesk 0 2
+ "  Misc Desk"    MoveToDesk 0 3

DestroyModuleConfig FvwmIconMan:*
*FvwmIconMan: NumManagers 1
*FvwmIconMan: 1 Resolution global
*FvwmIconMan: 1 ButtonGeometry 120x30
*FvwmIconMan: 1 ManagerGeometry 1x1
*FvwmIconMan: 1 ReliefThickness 2
*FvwmIconMan: DrawIcons always

# Left click Window Activation / Window Selection Toggle.
*FvwmIconMan: Action Mouse 1 N sendcommand IconManClick

# Ctrl + Left Click minimize the window.
*FvwmIconMan: Action Mouse 1 C sendcommand IconManMinimize

# Auto-Paste macro:
# Middle click Primary Selection Pipe-to-Clipboard & Paste Automation.

*FvwmIconMan: Action Mouse 2 A sendcommand "Exec exec sh -c 'xclip -o -selection primary | xclip -i -selection clipboard; xdotool windowactivate --sync $[w.id] key Shift+Insert key Return'"

# Taskbar Context Menu:
# Right click Taskbar Context Menu.

*FvwmIconMan: Action Mouse 3 A sendcommand Nop
*FvwmIconMan: Action Mouse 3 A sendcommand TriggerIconManMenu

# Scroll Up and Down: Move the window one Desk up and down

*FvwmIconMan: Action Mouse 4 A sendcommand "MoveToDesk +1"
*FvwmIconMan: Action Mouse 5 A sendcommand "MoveToDesk -1"

## Check .fvwm/Extension/Colorsets.sys

*FvwmIconMan: 1 Colorset 36       # Default state (Inactive windows)
*FvwmIconMan: 1 FocusColorset 41  # Active / Focused window 
*FvwmIconMan: 1 SelectColorset 0  # When hovering/clicking the button
*FvwmIconMan: 1 IconColorset 0    # Minimized / Iconified windows
